	(text "GPIO0 (BOOT) has an internal pull-up. GPIO3, 45, 46 are strapping\npins left open: their defaults give a normal boot with USB.\nGPIO19 / 20 are the USB pair. Touch is read by U7, not the module.\nIO21 high = LED rail on. IO11 = spine data, IO48 = eye data.\nUnlabelled pins are spare and not brought out."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 149.86 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "446b3ee7-4bf0-55fd-b53a-713fe22b79b9")
	)
