	(text "One I2C bus, nose to tail: touch 0x5C, motion 0x6A, compass 0x2C,\ntemperature / humidity 0x44, light 0x29, pressure 0x46 (page 4), plus Qwiic.\nR17, R18 are 2.2k for the length of the bus. Use 100 kHz unless measured.\nQwiic: 1 GND, 2 3V3, 3 SDA, 4 SCL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 157.48 0)
		(effects
